      "sourceTextSha256": "9dae334ceddec4b7950fc41a4a9957e1a6fbbe72f9e6fe267bf140b0add30239",
      "text": "Eight South American Countries in 32 Days: From Rio and Iguazú to the Galápagos and Colombia",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-113a0f7cb039-mwa5n0tf-qk0eyn5ma27",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "2245d13cc6629b26df3501e53b39bbfb373e89f4e8427c52c6cabc7837e6b4b4",
      "text": "Travel through Brazil, Argentina, Uruguay, Chile, Bolivia, Peru, Ecuador and Colombia from 22 October to 22 November 2026. Over 32 days, the route links Rio, Iguazú Falls, Buenos Aires and Montevideo with the Atacama, Uyuni, Machu Picchu, the Galápagos and cities in Colombia. You’ll stay in 4-star hotels, and domestic flights are included.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-113a0f7cb039-mwa5n0tf-qk0eyn5ma27",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:priceNote:9b6b7f5cf7b1e557",
      "field": "priceNote",
      "sourceTextSha256": "c4dc4bae1b8b13eb462ddfa74f31bc0d4afd11c97f583d5dff97138d1e492186",
      "text": "Per person: $15,500 based on two people sharing a double room, or $18,600 in a single room. Accommodation is in 4-star hotels. Domestic flights are included. Your final price is confirmed when you book, taking flight costs into account.",
